---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../../components/Button.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Maternity Portfolio"
  description="Maternity photography portfolio by MellSnap. Beautiful pregnancy photos in London."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="label mb-4">Portfolio</p>
        <h1
          class="font-cormorant text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-primary-text"
        >
          Maternity
        </h1>
        <p
          class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
        >
          Celebrating the beautiful journey of motherhood and the anticipation
          of new life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="container">
      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        Maternity Photography Celebrating The Most Beautiful Moments
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        Your pregnancy is one of the most special times in your life. What
        better way to celebrate this incredible journey than with a maternity
        photoshoot? It's a perfect chance to capture those precious moments and
        show off your beautiful bump. An outdoor maternity photoshoot in
        London's stunning locations creates lasting memories and reflects the
        unique connection between you and your baby.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        I didn't have a maternity photoshoot when I was pregnant with my
        daughter, and I regret it to this day. My husband took a few photos with
        his phone, but they just don't compare. The preparation, experience, and
        quality of a professional maternity shoot capture so much more—the
        excitement, the love, and that indescribable bond I felt. From the first
        flutter in my tummy to those little kicks, it would have been wonderful
        to look back on those memories through beautifully crafted images.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        That's why I'm passionate about helping you capture this special time.
        Years from now, when you look at your maternity photos, I want you to
        feel that connection all over again.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/063-Web.webp"
          alt="Maternity photo"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/003-Web-e1731516397349.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman around flowers at Isabella plantation in Richmond park, maternity photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/018-Web-e1731531552915.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman around flowers at Isabella plantation in Richmond park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/048-Web-e1731532110866.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman around flowers at Isabella plantation in Richmond park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/056-Web-e1731531970342.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman around flowers at Isabella plantation in Richmond park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/034-Web.webp"
          alt="Maternity photo"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        Capturing Your Unique Bond
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        A maternity photoshoot is all about celebrating the bond between you,
        your partner, and the new life growing inside you. Whether it's your
        first baby or you're adding to your family, this experience is unique. I
        strive to create a relaxed and personal session that reflects the love
        and joy you feel.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        During our time together, we'll highlight your gorgeous baby bump and
        capture the connection between you, your partner, and any older
        siblings. We'll focus on those tender moments of anticipation, the
        smiles, and even the quiet reflections.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/059-Web.jpg"
          alt="Husband and wife kissing, expecting another child, little boy kissing mum's tummy"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/039-Web-1.jpg"
          alt="Maternity photoshoot for a family, in a park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/036-Web.jpg"
          alt="Maternity photoshoot for a family, little boy kissing mum's tummy"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        The Perfect Setting: Outdoor Maternity Photoshoots in London
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        All of my maternity photo sessions take place outdoors in beautiful
        London parks and green spaces. There's something truly magical about
        blending the natural beauty of a park or garden with your pregnancy
        glow. London offers a variety of picturesque locations—from the open
        spaces of Hyde Park to the tranquil paths of Richmond Park, there's a
        perfect spot waiting for you.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        <a
          href="/blog/why-parks-are-ideal-for-a-family-photoshoot/"
          class="text-pink hover:underline"
          >Outdoor shoots are perfect for catching the natural light, especially
          during golden hour, just before sunset</a
        >. But don't worry—if the weather is against us, we can always find a
        sheltered spot, like some nice café or reschedule for a day when the
        conditions are better. Cloudy skies often times are better, because the
        lighting is even and doesn't create unpleasant shadows beneath the eyes.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-13-e1731530967834.jpg"
          alt="Love couple expecting their first child, doing a maternity photoshoot at Woodland gardens in Bushy park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-47.jpg"
          alt="Couple expecting their first child, doing a photoshoot at Woodland gardens in Bushy park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-34-e1731513826526.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman and her husband in a park, enjoying warm weather and taking a maternity photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-28-e1731531110962.jpg"
          alt="Love couple expecting their first child, doing a maternity photoshoot at Woodland gardens in Bushy park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-43.jpg"
          alt="Couple expecting their first child, doing a photoshoot at Woodland gardens in Bushy park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/01-Web-16.jpg"
          alt="Couple expecting their first child, doing a photoshoot at Woodland gardens in Bushy park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        Timing Your Maternity Photoshoot
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        I recommend scheduling your maternity photoshoot around 32-34 weeks
        pregnant. At this stage, your bump will be prominent and beautifully
        rounded, while still being comfortable enough for movement. If you're
        expecting multiples or have an earlier due date, we can adjust the
        timing to suit your needs.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        It's a good idea to book your session early, ideally during the early
        weeks of your second trimester. We'll plan around your schedule and
        preferences, ensuring a relaxed and enjoyable experience.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/111-Web.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman and man holding hands, walking on a nice path way on a sunny day"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/001-Web-1-e1731531453128.jpg"
          alt="A couple expecting a baby, doing a maternity photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/047-Web.jpg"
          alt="Couple expecting their first child, doing a photoshoot at Canbury gardens in Kingston"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/065-Web.jpg"
          alt="Couple sitting on a bench, the man kissing his lovely wife"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/076-Web-1.jpg"
          alt="Wife and husband head to head, expecting their first child"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/125-Web.jpg"
          alt="Couple expecting their first child, doing a photoshoot at Canbury gardens in Kingston"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        What to Expect During Your Maternity Photoshoot
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        Every maternity session is tailored to you. Whether you want a candid,
        natural look or something more styled, I'll guide you through the
        process. There's no pressure to pose perfectly—just be yourself and let
        your connection to your baby shine. I'll gently direct you when needed,
        but the best moments come from unscripted, genuine interactions.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        If you include your partner or children in the session, we'll capture
        lovely family moments too. These photos become part of your family's
        story, making the session even more special.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/DSCF1958.webp"
          alt="Maternity photo"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/DSCF1606-1.webp"
          alt="Maternity photo"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/DSCF1633-1.webp"
          alt="Maternity photo"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        Don't Worry About the Weather
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        It's natural to worry about the unpredictable London weather, but cloudy
        days can actually be great for photography! The soft, diffused light is
        incredibly flattering and adds a gentle, peaceful feel to your photos.
        And if it does rain, we can adapt by finding a sheltered spot or even
        heading to a cosy café for some unique and intimate shots. Cloudy days
        offer beautifully soft light, so we can still capture stunning images,
        no matter the weather.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/018-Web-1.jpg"
          alt="Family of three, soon to be four in a park, enjoying time together while taking a photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/024-Web-e1731531739520.jpg"
          alt="Pregnant woman and her first son in a park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/026-Web-e1731531505156.jpg"
          alt="Family of three, soon to be four in a park, enjoying time together while taking a photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        All Successful Images Just For You
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        I keep things simple, offering you all the successful images from our
        session—typically between 80 to 100 photos. This gives you plenty to
        choose from without the hassle of selecting a limited number. Once the
        shoot is complete, you'll receive all the softly edited images in a
        private online gallery, allowing you to download and print them wherever
        and whenever you like.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        It's all about making sure you have the freedom to enjoy your photos in
        a way that suits you.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/070-Web.jpg"
          alt="Maternity photo session in Richmond Terrace Gardens, London, featuring a glowing expectant mother surrounded by lush greenery"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/082-Web-1.jpg"
          alt="Maternity photo session in Richmond Terrace Gardens, London, featuring a glowing expectant mother surrounded by lush greenery"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/maternity/097-Web-1.jpg"
          alt="Maternity photo session in Richmond Terrace Gardens, London, featuring a glowing expectant mother surrounded by lush greenery"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-hover w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text font-bold mb-6"
      >
        Let's Create Your Maternity Photoshoot Perfect
      </h2>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-6">
        Pregnancy is such a fleeting time, but the memories we capture together
        will last a lifetime. Whether we're exploring one of London's beautiful
        parks or finding the perfect outdoor spot, I'll be there to guide you
        every step of the way and ensure your maternity photoshoot is a relaxed
        and enjoyable experience.
      </p>

      <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-12">
        Ready to book your outdoor maternity photoshoot in London? Get in touch,
        and we'll start planning your session, tailored just for you and your
        family.
      </p>

      <div class="text-center mt-16">
        <Button href="/free-consultation/" variant="primary">
          Book a Maternity Session
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Back Link -->
  <section class="py-10 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="nav-link hover:text-pink transition-colors">
        &larr; Back to Portfolio
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
